New tests on Postgres 16. smtp.test.ts (4, no database):
- STARTTLS upgrade with a trusted self-signed openssl certificate: only EHLO and STARTTLS travel in the clear, and AUTH, MAIL, RCPT and DATA go inside TLS;
- an untrusted certificate: refused before any AUTH;
- no STARTTLS on a non-loopback address (192.0.2.2 here): refused after EHLO, with nothing sent;
- a loopback relay without TLS is allowed.
notifications.test.ts gains a test that in-app crisis alerts are unchanged beside Slack and a not-set-up email.
intake-hook-vault.test.ts (2):
- the migration runs on a scratch database: 2 plaintext secrets are sealed and open with crypto.ts, they are bound to the workspace, and the column is dropped; without a key it rejects and nothing changes;
- rotation end to end: viewers and another workspace are refused, the new secret is shown once, neither secret is in the stored action, the old one gives 200 inside the window and 401 after it.
duty-roster.test.ts (2) uses fixed instants (Monday 10:00 IST, 20:00 IST, Saturday) to cover weekly hours, leave, cover, the role fallback, a timezone change to Asia/Dubai, the refusals, and email to the person on shift only through a fake SMTP server.
